{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03557","headline":"拟古东飞伯劳西飞燕 · 李峤","name":"拟古东飞伯劳西飞燕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"传书青鸟迎箫凤，巫岭荆台数通梦。\n谁家窈窕住园楼，五马千金照陌头。\n罗裙玉佩当轩出，点翠施红竞春日。\n佳人二八盛舞歌，羞将百万呈双蛾。\n庭前芳树朝夕改，空驻妍华欲谁待。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}